_model: page
---
title: About
---
body:

As Technical Lead and Senior DevOps / Platform Engineer at CK-THINK, I take a lead design, scaling, and optimizing the infrastructure that powers healthcare solutions. with 8+ years of software engineering experience, including 5+ years operating Kubernetes, AWS, and hybrid cloud infrastructure in production.

My background spans healthcare platform architecture, high-availability infrastructure, GitOps automation, and backend engineering.
<br><br>
### Career Highlights

- **Healthcare Scale**: Architected systems deployed across 14 hospitals, supporting 24 microservices and ~1,400 daily users with a 99.95% SLA.
- **Production Kubernetes**: Designed and operated 5 production clusters across 36 nodes (AWS EKS and on-premises), plus unified observability across 48 production and UAT nodes.
- **Internal Developer Platform & GitOps**: Built automated CI/CD and deployment pipelines that cut release cycles from ~5 minutes to ~50 seconds.
- **Healthcare Standards**: Engineered real-time hospital integrations and clinical imaging workflows using HL7, MLLP, PACS, and LIS.
- **DevSecOps & Compliance**: Implemented zero-trust identity with Keycloak and OAuth2, enforcing compliance standards for sensitive healthcare data.

### Approach

I enjoy solving complex infrastructure, reliability, and architecture problems, but I remain hands-on writing code, debugging systems, and building automation pipelines.

***

